# {{ project_name }}

A Python project scaffolded with [scaffold-ca-python](https://github.com/scaffold-ca-python/scaffold-ca-python) following **Clean Architecture** principles.

## Project structure

```
{{ package }}/
├── domain/
│   ├── model/          # Entities (dataclasses) and gateway interfaces (ports)
│   │   └── gateways/   # Abstract protocols — define WHAT adapters must do
│   └── usecase/        # Use case classes — orchestrate business logic
├── infrastructure/
│   ├── driven_adapters/ # Concrete gateway implementations (DB, HTTP, queues …)
│   ├── entry_points/    # Delivery mechanisms (REST, events, CLI …)
│   └── helpers/         # Shared utilities for adapters and entry points
├── app/                 # Composition root — DI wiring, application entry point
└── deployment/          # Dockerfile and CI/CD pipeline files
```

## Layer dependency rules

```
domain/model        ← no imports from other layers
domain/usecase      ← may import from domain/model only
infrastructure/     ← may import from domain/
app/                ← may import from any layer (composition root)
```

Run `scaffold validate` at any time to check for violations.

